  "body": "This PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Type | Update | Change | References |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| react-test-renderer | devDependencies | patch | `15.6.1` -> `15.6.2` | [homepage](https://reactjs.org/), [source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/facebook/react) |\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>facebook/react</summary>\n\n### [`v15.6.2`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/facebook/react/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;1562-September-25-2017)\n\n[Compare Source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/facebook/react/compare/v15.6.1...v15.6.2)\n\n##### All Packages\n\n-   Switch from BSD + Patents to MIT license\n\n##### React DOM\n\n-   Fix a bug where modifying `document.documentMode` would trigger IE detection in other browsers, breaking change events. ([@&#8203;aweary](https://renovatebot.com/gh/aweary) in [#&#8203;10032](https://renovatebot.com/gh/facebook/react/pull/10032))\n-   CSS Columns are treated as unitless numbers. ([@&#8203;aweary](https://renovatebot.com/gh/aweary) in [#&#8203;10115](https://renovatebot.com/gh/facebook/react/pull/10115))\n-   Fix bug in QtWebKit when wrapping synthetic events in proxies. ([@&#8203;walrusfruitcake](https://renovatebot.com/gh/walrusfruitcake) in [#&#8203;10115](https://renovatebot.com/gh/facebook/react/pull/10011))\n-   Prevent event handlers from receiving extra argument in development. ([@&#8203;aweary](https://renovatebot.com/gh/aweary) in [#&#8203;10115](https://renovatebot.com/gh/facebook/react/pull/8363))\n-   Fix cases where `onChange` would not fire with `defaultChecked` on radio inputs. ([@&#8203;jquense](https://renovatebot.com/gh/jquense) in [#&#8203;10156](https://renovatebot.com/gh/facebook/react/pull/10156))\n-   Add support for `controlList` attribute to DOM property whitelist ([@&#8203;nhunzaker](https://renovatebot.com/gh/nhunzaker) in [#&#8203;9940](https://renovatebot.com/gh/facebook/react/pull/9940))\n-   Fix a bug where creating an element with a ref in a constructor did not throw an error in development. ([@&#8203;iansu](https://renovatebot.com/gh/iansu) in [#&#8203;10025](https://renovatebot.com/gh/facebook/react/pull/10025))\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Renovate configuration\n\n:date: **Schedule**: \"every weekend\" in timezone Europe/Paris.\n\n:vertical_traffic_light: **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n:recycle: **Rebasing**: Whenever PR is stale, or if you modify the PR title to begin with \"`rebase!`\".\n\n:no_bell: **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update again.\n\n---\n\n - [ ] <!-- renovate-rebase -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check this box\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://renovatebot.com/gh/marketplace/renovate). View repository job log [here](https://renovatebot.com/dashboard#algolia/instantsearch.js).",
